  "kind": "positive",
  "description": "ClientDBInfo as a bare table: two GRV proxies and two commit proxies (each a request_stream endpoint: GrvProxyInterface::getConsistentReadVersion and CommitProxyInterface::commit; the other endpoints are derived with Endpoint::getAdjustedEndpoint, commit index 1 = GRV (unused), 2 = getKeyServersLocations on both branches). The first proxy of each kind has a secondary (TLS) address. 8.0 slots: (grvProxies, commitProxies, id, forward, history, clusterId, clusterType, nativeCdcEnabled, nativeCdcTagCount, cdcProxies (CDCProxyInterface), streamToCDCProxyId (std::map<u64, UID>)). 7.4 had tenantMode, encryptKeyProxy and metaclusterName instead of the four CDC fields.",
